y sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth and sloth sloth\n\n# Print 'W' (87)\nslothy sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth\nsloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth and sloth sloth\n\n# Print 'o' (111)\nslothy sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth and sloth sloth\n\n# Print 'r' (114)\nslothy sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth and sloth sloth\n\n# Print 'l' (108)\nslothy sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth and sloth sloth\n\n# Print 'd' (100)\nslothy sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth and sloth sloth\n\n# Print '\\n' (10)\nslothy sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth\nslothy sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth\nsloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth sloth and sloth sloth\nnap","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
